---
title: Order flow
---
flowchart TD
    A[Customer places order] --> B{In stock?}
    B -- yes --> C[Reserve items]
    B -- no --> D[Notify customer]
    C --> E[Take payment]
    E --> F{Payment ok?}
    F -- yes --> G[Ship order]
    F -- no --> H[Release items]
    G --> I((Done))
    D --> I
    H --> I

%% Opening a file
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant V as Viewer
    participant F as File
    U->>V: open example.mmd
    V->>F: read
    F-->>V: text
    loop while open
        F-->>V: changed
        V->>V: redraw
    end
    V-->>U: diagram

%% Life of an order
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Placed
    Placed --> Paid: payment received
    Placed --> Cancelled: timeout
    Paid --> Shipped
    Shipped --> Delivered
    Shipped --> Returned: refused
    Delivered --> [*]
    Returned --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]

